      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 2,
      "secondaryCue": 1,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "你今天怎么这么早就起来了\nWhy are you up so early today?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "ts": "00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 3,
      "secondaryCue": 2,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "我睡不着 干脆起来煮点咖啡\nI couldn't sleep, so I figured I'd make some coffee."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "ts": "00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,800",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 4,
      "secondaryCue": 3,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "你要不要也来一杯 我煮了一大壶 够我们两个人喝一整个上午\nDo you want a cup too? I made a big pot, enough for both of us to drink all morning."
    },
