      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 7,
      "secondaryCue": 6,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "楼下那家店的新iPhone壳打八折 我昨天顺手买了一个\nThe shop downstairs has phone cases at 20% off, so I grabbed one yesterday."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "ts": "00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 8,
      "secondaryCue": 7,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "一共是128.50元 比网上便宜了差不多30块\nIt came to 128.50 in total, about 30 cheaper than online."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "ts": "00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,000",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 9,
      "secondaryCue": 8,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "说明书上写着去 https://example.com/help/setup?step=2 下载App\nThe manual says to go to https://example.com/help/setup?step=2 and get the app."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "ts": "00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,000",
