      "index": 13,
      "ts": "00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,200",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "coverage-merge",
      "timingSource": "secondary",
      "primaryCue": 11,
      "secondaryCue": 10,
      "groupId": "cover-11-10-11",
      "text": "其实我一直想跟你说 下个月我可能要搬到离公司近一点的地方去住\nThere's something I've been meaning to tell you."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "ts": "00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,100",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "coverage-merge",
      "timingSource": "secondary",
      "primaryCue": 11,
      "secondaryCue": 11,
      "groupId": "cover-11-10-11",
      "text": "其实我一直想跟你说 下个月我可能要搬到离公司近一点的地方去住\nI might move closer to work next month."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "ts": "00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,000",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
