      "index": 16,
      "ts": "00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,000",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 13,
      "secondaryCue": 13,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "嗯 每天通勤两个小时 实在是太累了\nYeah. Two hours of commuting every day is just too much."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "ts": "00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,500",
      "type": "lyrics",
      "cueKind": "lyrics",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 14,
      "secondaryCue": 14,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "♪ 窗外的雨一直下 ♪\n♪ The rain keeps falling outside ♪"
