    {
      "index": 18,
      "ts": "00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,800",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 15,
      "secondaryCue": 15,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "那周末我帮你一起看房子吧 顺便去吃那家我们一直说要去的面馆\nThen let me help you look at places this weekend, and we can finally try that noodle place we keep talking about."
    },
